  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "計算機程式",
    "sub_ename": "COMPUTER PROGRAMMING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以Python程式語言為主體，介紹程式語言基礎及程式設計的方法，內容著重程式設計能力之訓練及其在工程上之應用。使學生具備分析工程問題及程式設計，並利用電腦來求解問題的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The course based on Python programming languages to introduce the programming syntax, algorithm and writing the program. The content focuses on the programming design capacity training and its application in engineering. This course is designed to take students from limited computer experience through a basic knowledge capable of solving undergraduate level programming tasks.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
